* parameters.type 1..1 code "Must be selected from: Code_System_Identifier | Demographic_Attribute | Content_Asset_Mnemonic | Simple_Text_Parameter"
* prerequisiteSAMMnemonic 0..1 id "TBD"
* hdqtDimensionMnemonic 1..1 code "Must align to PIQI HQDT Dimensions (e.g. Plausibility.Clinical)"
* executionTypeMnemonic 1..1 code "Must be selected from: Primitive_Logic | Regex_Pattern | Stored_Procedure | RESTful_Service | Value_Set_Enum | Value_Set_Code"
